{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>This day.</b> On which you enter with Him into a covenant. The nature of the covenant is this: that El, blessed be He, commands you to perform the statutes and judgments for your good, and you undertake upon yourself to keep them." "<b>With all your heart.</b> That you recognize without any doubt that it is fitting to do His will." "<b>And with all your soul.</b> That no desiring faculty deter you, since you recognize the excellence of the One who commanded and the benefit of His commandments — and by this."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:15.480523688Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}